# triage-check default report output (maintainer tool)
triage-report.json

# Load-bearing for CI, not local hygiene — do not remove as cleanup.
# The Test step writes test.log into the repo root (`go test ... | tee
# test.log`), and the later "Hook-fixture mutation gate" step runs
# bench/hookmutate/mutate.py, which hard-exits on `git status --porcelain`
# being non-empty ("refusing to run: working tree is dirty"). That check
# respects .gitignore, so this entry is the only thing keeping the mutation
# gate runnable on every pull request. Delete this line and every PR fails.
test.log
